            "relation": "USES_PHYSICAL_SCHEME",
            "target_entity_instance": "Mistchlinch function",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The selection procedure for the base model of stand basal area (BAS) followed a similar approach to that of the SCI model. Based on the evaluation of statistical indicators (adjR2, MAE%, and RMSE %), diagnostic residual plots, and model convergence stability (particularly when considering climate and development stage variables), the Mistchlinch function was ultimately selected to describe the relationship between BAS and stand age (t).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "stand carbon stock model (CAR)",
