            "target_entity_instance": "negative exponential relationship",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "In undisturbed natural forests, a typically negative exponential relationship exists between the number of trees per hectare and the corresponding diameter class (West, 2009):",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
